      en: ["The original mosque structure was established as early as 1881.", "The main prayer hall has the capacity to hold up to 6,000 people.", "It was for a long time the largest mosque in the Southern Hemisphere.", "The iconic golden domes were added to the design in 1905.", "It is located in the heart of Durban's central business district on Grey Street.", "The building is a designated national monument of South Africa."],
