      en: ["The building was officially opened to the public in 1935.", "The clock tower stands at a height of approximately 47 meters.", "The grand organ inside the hall contains a total of 6,326 pipes.", "The structure was built to mark Pretoria's transition to a city in 1931.", "The bells in the carillon were specially cast in the Netherlands.", "Statues of Andries and Marthinus Pretorius guard the main entrance."],
