      en: ["Commissioned on October 1, 1936.", "Last manually controlled lighthouse in SA.", "Named after a barque wrecked in 1829.", "Height: 15-meter masonry tower.", "Light range: 32 nautical miles.", "Located in Cape Columbine Nature Reserve."],
